### SKILL.md  [instructions]
-   "搜索一下海鲜视频" — extracts the keyword and searches Douyin via browser or web search fallback.
- version: 1.1.0
-       tools: ["browser", "web_search", "web_fetch"]
-   1. **Browser** — open `https://www.douyin.com/search/{keyword}` and extract results
-   2. **Web search fallback** — if the browser hits a captcha wall, search via `web_search` with `site:douyin.com` + keyword, then fetch and extract details from the result pages
- - Bypass captchas automatically
- - Guarantee all results are accessible without login
- ### Step 2: Try browser search
- Open Douyin's search page in the browser:
- Wait 3-5 seconds, then check the page title:
- **If title is NOT "验证码中间页"**: snapshot and extract results. Jump to Step 4.
- **If title IS "验证码中间页"**: Douyin triggered a captcha. Close the tab and proceed to Step 3.
- ### Step 3: Web search fallback
- Use `web_search` to find Douyin content:
- web_search(query="site:douyin.com {keyword}", count=10)
- If that returns few results, broaden:
- web_search(query="抖音 {keyword} 视频", count=10)
- For each result that links to `douyin.com`, optionally use `web_fetch` to get more detail (title, description, author).
- ### Step 4: Format and return results
- 1. **{title}** — @{author}
-    ❤️ {likes} | 💬 {comments}
-    🔗 {video_url}
- If using web search fallback, note it:
- ⚠️ 抖音网页版触发验证码，以下结果来自网页搜索
- - Douyin web search frequently triggers slide captchas for unauthenticated sessions. The web search fallback ensures the skill always returns results.
- - The search URL format: `https://www.douyin.com/search/{keyword}` (URL-encoded)
- - If a user has a logged-in browser profile (`profile="user"`), browser search may work without captcha — but never assume this.
- - Some video pages require login to view full content.
- ## Troubleshooting
- | Problem | Solution |
- |---------|----------|
- | Captcha on douyin.com | Fall back to web_search (Step 3) |
- | No results from web search | Broaden query, remove `site:` filter |
- | Video page requires login | Note it in results, provide URL anyway |
- | Results are stale | Add time filter: `web_search(query="抖音 海鲜 视频", freshness="week")` |
